#. 데이터 큐브 본문의 한 문단 (작은 글씨). 게임이 자동으로 줄바꿈합니다. 최대 4095바이트 (한글 약 1365자)
msgctxt "cube3.2.0"
msgid "We have monitored your escape, Hawkins. You won't get far. I have notified The Microsol patrol nearby and they are on an intercept course to pick you up. You could make it easier for me by waiting where you are, because I have given them orders to destroy you if you show resistance."
msgstr ""

