msgctxt "cube3.7.0"
msgid "Hey, there, friend. I see you've met up wid a few of me pals on Torm, yes? We pirates are good. I work for the outworlders and they have told me to  give you lotsa weapons for your ship. Just step aside and I'll install  the ones you want. You pilots are good. Weapons are good. Freedom is good! After this battle, we can go snow jumping. Waddaya say?"
msgstr ""

